  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1935\">\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1774\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1772\">Pass (Sterilization Effective):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1935\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1822\">\n<p data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1822\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Control shows <strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1803\">growth</strong> (spores viable).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1881\">\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1881\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Test indicator shows <strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1861\">no growth</strong> after incubation.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1935\">\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1935\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Indicates sterilization parameters were adequate.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2103\">\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1978\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1976\">Fail (Sterilization Ineffective):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2103\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2017\">\n<p data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2017\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Test indicator shows <strong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2014\">growth</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2103\">\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2103\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Sterilizer cycle must be investigated; load should not be used until reprocessed.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2185\">\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2185\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Must be recorded as part of <strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2182\">Quality Control and NABH/NABL documentation</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
